---
import MainLayout from "../../layouts/MainLayout.astro";

const title = "Packet Intake | Just-In Desk";
const description = "Agenda packet intake checklist for routing new documents into StayJustIn issue workspaces.";
---

<MainLayout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  canonical="https://www.stayjustin.com/desk/intake/"
>
  <section class="article-page">
    <div class="container article-container">
      <p class="page-kicker">Just-In Desk</p>
      <h1>New Packet Intake</h1>

      <p class="article-dek">
        This is the manual MVP for processing agenda packets before automated PDF intake exists.
        Use this checklist to route each item into the right issue workspace.
      </p>

      <section class="intake-box">
        <h2>Packet Intake Checklist</h2>
        <ol>
          <li>Name the packet by meeting date and body, such as <strong>2026-07-07 City Council Packet</strong>.</li>
          <li>List each agenda item that matters to residents.</li>
          <li>Assign every item to one or more issues, such as Street Sweeping, Athens, Budget, or City Yard.</li>
          <li>Copy key quotes, page numbers, dollar amounts, maps, deadlines, and staff recommendations into the issue evidence binder.</li>
          <li>Add timeline events only when something changed.</li>
          <li>Create tasks for anything that needs verification, public records, or follow-up coverage.</li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <section class="intake-box">
        <h2>Issue Routing Template</h2>
        <pre><code>Packet: YYYY-MM-DD City Council Packet
Agenda Item:
Issue(s):
What changed:
Resident impact:
Money mentioned:
Key quote:
Page number:
Needs verification:
Follow-up task:
Publish to:</code></pre>
      </section>

      <section class="intake-box">
        <h2>Routing Rule</h2>
        <p>
          The packet is the inbox. The issue is the filing cabinet. If one agenda item affects
          Street Sweeping and Budget, it belongs in both issue workspaces without duplicating the whole packet.
        </p>
      </section>

      <p>
        <a href="/desk/" class="desk-link">← Back to Desk</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>

<style>
  .intake-box {
    margin: 2rem 0;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    background: #f8fafc;
  }

  .intake-box h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .intake-box li {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  pre {
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    padding: 1rem;
    background: #111827;
    color: #f9fafb;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .desk-link {
    font-weight: 800;
  }
</style>
